sequenceDiagram
  participant U as President
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as Server
  U->>B: email + password
  B->>S: POST /login
  S-->>B: session (face_pending)
  B->>S: frames: straight + head turn
  S->>S: SFace match >= 0.50 and yaw >= 0.20
  S-->>B: session active (60 min) + log entry
  U->>B: sensitive action
  B->>S: request
  S-->>B: 428 face_reverify (if older than 10 min)
  B->>S: fresh face check, then retry
